WEBVTT

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.620
As long as justice exists in this world,

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.830
(Narrate by Seiko Senoo)
evil would still remain.

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.210
Behind the war between justice and evil,

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.880
there is a group of unknown warriors.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:28.080
Never thought that the fortress I built
hidden in dimension gap could be discovered.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.790
(Leader of Trancer)
Unexpectedly, not by the enemy,

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.420
(Arachne, the Weaver)
but one of us.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.080
Interesting.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.830
What's your intention?

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.540
Please stamp.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:43.360
Huh?

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:46.920
I'm here to ask you to endorse this document.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.420
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:05.250
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.330
♫Live within the current power♫

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.460
♫Special force♫

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:18.640
(Miss Kuroitsu from the Monster Development Department)
♫Special force♫

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:24.040
♫Everyone possesses this power (Power)♫

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.820
♫Being locked up without realising it♫

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.190
♫You are the courageous flower (Flower)♫

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:31.950
♫Fighting against with nonsense today♫

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.040
♫Warfare against the sleepiness in the morning♫

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.830
♫Psychological warfare begins at forenoon,
bringing the project to the meeting♫

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:40.500
♫Don't lose. You'll be fine♫

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.460
♫It's gonna be ok!!♫

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:45.080
♫The hardworking one deserves respect♫

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.590
♫You'll be rewarded one day♫

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.510
♫Wake up and believe in this power.
Do it again♫

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:53.580
♫Everyone is special.
Only one, Let's go!!♫

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:57.060
♫Keep striving to march forward
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:59.520
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:04.310
♫Persistence empowers you.
The important special force♫

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:07.750
♫Keep striving to march forward today
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:10.530
♫Grit your teeth and endure it
(Hang in there!!)♫

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:13.200
♫Keep it up. Stronger♫

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.960
♫With your beautiful special force♫

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.710
(Episode 5: Signing a Contract With a Demon
From the Abyss Is Like the Ring of King Solomon)

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:21.000
(Which Was Saved by a Smile,
Even Though at the Prize of Destroying Oneself.)

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.000
(Monster Development Department)

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.750
Professor, the application for new equipment
has finally been approved.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.380
Our constant efforts to apply have paid off,
Miss Kuroitsu.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:31.830
(Professor Hajime Sadamaki)
Therefore, we could have more new materials

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.760
(Touka Kuroitsu, Assistant)
for our research.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:36.830
Perhaps there'll be additional manpower
if we make some achievements.

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.460
(Monster Development Department of Agastia)
Speaking of which,

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.210
(Wolf Bete, Novice Assistant)
What's this document about?

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.500
That's the project approval document.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.580
Drats.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.780
I've missed out on this.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.290
The endorsement from the leaders.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:00.540
Both Wolf and I will get their stamps then.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:03.000
After all, we've got approval from Sir Megistus.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.080
It's just a formal procedure, isn't it?

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.170
Well, that sounds right though.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.040
New equipment?

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.920
I'm okay with it.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:17.050
(Immortal Camula, Leader of Omnipotent Cell)
But, I need to be more vigilant if it's you.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.750
Again.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:21.580
Aren't we friends, Madam Camula?

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.540
Alright then.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:31.170
But, such inefficient acts should be corrected.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:34.540
What do you mean by inefficient acts?

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.330
Kuroitsu.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:42.120
Do you know where do all leaders stay?

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.460
He did come for work but he's not here.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.120
You're looking for Mr. Eldridge, right?

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.250
He's conducting an experiment at this moment.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.460
An experiment?

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:59.830
Eldridge, the leader of the science consultant
is equipped with an incredible function,

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:03.080
which is called, Philadelphia Experiment.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:08.000
He's able to render himself invisible
to the world.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:14.170
Mr. Eldridge is now conducting that experiment.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:16.670
Though sometimes we could reach him...

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.960
Here he is.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.710
Mr. Eldridge, please stamp...

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:27.500
May I know how long would this condition last?

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.710
Previously, the longest record is a week.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:33.080
But, I'm not so sure about the duration...

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.670
Excuse me, have you seen this person?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.540
There should be a castle nearby here.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.790
Oh, my. What a strange one.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:46.210
I don't think I've seen this face here.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:50.830
Didn't Mr. Shigeru say he saw a giant silhouette
flying in the direction of the mountain?

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.920
Why do those leaders build their own place?

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.170
Fafnir, the leader of dragons

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:06.830
is in charge of supervising the special treasure
that would inflict a curse on its possessor.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.330
In order to perform this task,

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:12.710
he stays inside the mountains of remote land.

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:30.790
Though I've checked with the headquarter
about the surveillance location,

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:34.230
I didn't expect it could be so deep.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:37.170
(Kraken, Leader of Naval Warfare)
You're able to sneak in here without equipment,

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:40.500
you must be a monster.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.240
However, I'm not sure
whether you belong to Agastia.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.330
I'm here to ask you to stamp this document.

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.920
I, Kraken

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.080
am not bragging,

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.250
but I'm the most cautious monster in Agastia
and I'm proud of this.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:57.500
That's why they've entrusted
the surveillance station to me.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:03.830
Now, I'm going to make a thorough investigation
of you.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.620
No way.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:14.270
Please state

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:20.210
your address, name, age, blood type,
identity number, and manufacturer number.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.790
And also your favourite quote
and the food you loathe.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.750
The first CD you bought, your motto,

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.960
ideal partner, favourite magazine,

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:32.370
which leg do you step on first
when you bathe in the hot spring.

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.670
Write it down carefully.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:35.620
Huh?

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:39.460
I'll confirm your identity with the headquarter.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.210
And we'll talk about the business later.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:46.050
I...can I change my clothes first?

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.710
The endorsement was received two days later.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:05.750
I didn't expect that you'd pass through
the difficult Jaguar's base and reach here.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.250
Kuroitsu.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:12.500
(Warrior of Jaguar, Leader of Strong Attack)
As a human, you have pretty good strength.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:15.790
You own my recognition, gal.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:17.170
Thank you.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:20.960
But, the way you talk is likely
to cause conflicts.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.460
Seriously? I apologise for that.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:28.960
However, don't think
that you can get my stamp easily.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:33.920
I'll give you only if you can beat me up
with a punch.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.540
Sure.

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:38.960
I've been under intense stress coming here.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:47.530
Could I be the leader if I defeat you?

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.370
Only if you succeed.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.780
Eat this.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:03.500
This is specially for you today.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.580
The champagne that shares
the same colour as your hair.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:10.710
Well... You could just help me to stamp
the document.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.420
No rush.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:18.500
I've booked the entire restaurant
to have dinner with you.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.890
Miss Bete.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:25.620
Miss Bete? You should know my origin
with your intelligence network, right?

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:28.750
(Uncle Long-range)
Of course.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.870
(Leader of Strategic Espionage)
What's wrong with that?

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:33.580
I see, Uncle Long-Range.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.000
No, should be Uncle Wide-Range. Am I right?

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.000
I've heard about your rumour.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:42.290
It's said that many female monsters
were harassed by you.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:47.210
I see. Do you mean something like this?

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:54.010
Why does my body freeze
with just a slight touch of his hand?

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:57.920
Muscles react for a reason.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:01.580
The created monster

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.520
is more likely to be controlled.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.620
Darn it. If this keeps going on, I will...

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.830
How's it?

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.790
Do you feel relaxed now?

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.620
My body has become lighter.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:28.800
It seems you've fallen into my trap too.

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.930
I've done stamping the document.

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:35.170
Uncle Long-Range, thank you.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.500
Please don't say that.

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:42.880
However, I still can't let it go.
Can I punch you?

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.580
Ladies always say this to me.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.730
Just one punch.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.110
Sure.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:55.380
Ladies are indeed mysterious creatures.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:03.250
It's over.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:05.710
Finally, we've collected all the stamps.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:07.120
Ouch.

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.830
Miss Kuroitsu, are you alright?

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:14.120
There's something good with Mr. Jaguar.
He won't be easy on you.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.710
I'll revenge him one day.

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.470
Are you alright, Wolf?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.370
Did Uncle Long-Range harass you, didn't he?

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.600
No.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.960
You've worked hard.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.920
I'm sorry to have you ask them for their stamps.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.620
Gosh!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.420
Hello, Monster Development Department speaking.

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:38.750
This is General Affairs Department.
You've worked hard.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.500
You too.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.710
Regarding the document approval form
you've just passed up,

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:49.460
we found that there are two stamps invalid.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:52.960
One of the stamps has the wrong year.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.010
Could you please fix it?

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:02.290
(Monster Development Department)
Darn job!

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.290
With this opportunity,

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.790
Agastia digitalised the document approval form.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.490
(Elbucky, the Space Cat)

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:19.240
Please have a look.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.000
Please have...

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.750
Isn't it great?

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.540
Tissue paper is free though.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:30.870
If heroes can only receive punches...

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.670
Please have a look.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.750
I'm back.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.650
Who is this guy?

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.710
You're back, Wolf.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:59.710
We have guests later. Get ready.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:01.620
Guests? This guy...

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:04.790
I mean...is he the guest?

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.500
No, he's Professor.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.800
What?

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:20.500
How come he's so handsome? That's annoying.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:22.460
He's annoying, right?

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:26.080
He has a handsome appearance yet he hides it.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:29.170
How dare you two criticise right before me?

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:30.830
You two.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:34.290
But, why are you in this suit instead?

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:39.580
I can't wear AR glasses to welcome the guests,
right?

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.830
Who's there?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.670
Who are you?

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:51.210
We've specially made a visit here,

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:54.330
yet the welcoming is dull, Agastia.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.080
(Monster Institute of Black Rock)
We're the Secret Society

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.000
(Koharu Hoen, Research Director)
Black Rock.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.500
Conquering the world

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.790
is under our thumb.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.350
Submit to us, useless brats.

00:13:05.350 --> 00:13:08.920
I've been waiting for you, Madam Hoen.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:14.170
I'm the assistant of the development department
and the head of front-line command, Kuroitsu.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:17.080
Hello, I'm Dr. Sadamaki.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:24.120
Professor, you're such a loser.
As someone has been working long, you've lost.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:27.290
I'm sorry, Miss Wolf.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.830
(Elbucky, the Space Cat)
Professor insisted to show up in this way.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.500
We even practiced it three times.
She's indeed...

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.120
Shut up, Elbucky.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:38.420
Polite greeting isn't the way
an evil organisation should do.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.920
I'm Dr. Koharu Hoen from Black Rock.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.830
Keep that in mind.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:47.540
My name is Elbucky. Please treat me favourably.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.040
Black Rock...

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.370
I work under Secret Society Black Rock,

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:54.710
Sir Alligator.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:56.710
Isn't the society that the darn alligator
belongs to?

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.690
That brat has already been revived...

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:02.750
Enough, Wolf. Quit saying.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:05.320
Otherwise, you'll cause conflicts.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:10.250
Do you think we would be fooled
with this little trick?

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:14.000
Even if you've tampered with his memory,
we'd discover it if his body is checked.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.370
So, are you here to revenge us?

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.620
No.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:23.460
How are we going to report that he has provoked
the hostile society and got sliced into pieces?

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.330
Instead, we're here to collude with you.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.000
That's right.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.210
Because we have our own trouble too.

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:32.870
Speaking of which,

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.080
long time no see. Sadamaki.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.460
Oh, right. I haven't seen you
since the exchange meeting last time.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:41.080
Do you know each other?

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:44.880
Of course. They were coursemates.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.750
Professor's coursemate?

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:50.960
She's older than me.

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.620
Hold on. I'm offended by your response.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:56.500
Monster Development Department of Agastia.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.250
It seems you have our monster
wrapped around your fingers.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.380
But, your arrogance has confused me.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:07.830
I'll show you my creation, Elbucky.

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:13.540
Elbucky's able to conduct close combat
with its strong body

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:17.710
as well as the eyes launch light beams
for long-range combat.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:28.910
All artificial organs and nerves
are such a state of the art.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.290
Let me show you the real strength.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:33.670
Go, Elbucky.

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:37.710
I'm not in the mood now.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:39.580
Right, Sister Wolf.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.290
Don't be so closed.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.920
You're so indifferent.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.620
The way to avoid my body

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.920
in either action or sight...

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.000
But, she's a girl...

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.670
It wouldn't be wrong.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:56.920
Space Cat, Elbucky

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.170
possess the flagship model of Black Rock

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.250
which the function is incredible,

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:04.070
But, not to its preference.

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:06.040
Cherry boy!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:10.080
What's your name? When's your birthday?
Your ideal partner? Your favourite magazine?

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:14.120
Which leg do you step on first
when you bathe in the hot spring?

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:17.210
What's wrong with this brat
who got excited out of the blue?

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.960
Oh my. Be serious.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:23.580
Are you here to show off your monster?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.120
Of course.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.470
After all, Black Rock and Agastia

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:29.840
is different in organisation's scale,

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.540
fund,

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.100
and vision.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:38.580
Therefore, no matter how smart you're,
you'll never surpass me.

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:43.790
Professor had never won Dr. Sadamaki in tests
when they were studying.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:47.990
She's a troublesome woman
who couldn't overcome her despised past.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:50.670
Don't simply reveal my personal information.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.710
Where has your law-abiding consciousness gone?

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:56.670
Monsters are equipment,

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:58.500
not subject to law enforcement.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:16:59.920
I see.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:02.420
It means both of you are enemies in the past.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:04.420
It's great to have such a connection though.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:07.790
I'm upset to be compared with him
as my opponent.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:11.790
Didn't I tell you I'm more outstanding than him?

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:15.210
I'm not an ordinary professor from
the ordinary development department,

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:18.120
I'm the institute director.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.710
Director?

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:22.650
It's so lame to show off your title.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:29.400
This is the premium Icy Peak Oolong Tea
and a set of Japanese desserts.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:32.500
Please have a taste.

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:35.250
It doesn't matter what's the title about,

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:37.750
I could tell from the workmanship of the monster

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:41.330
that you've improved a lot than before.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:45.210
You're indeed amazing, Ms. Hoen.

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:51.000
(Don't you think that Hoen is irritating?)
(She always has her nose in the air.)

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.120
(Annoying.)
(Hoen doesn't have a friend.)

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:57.120
You're more outstanding than the others.

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.370
Don't mind them.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:06.670
You'll know it once you enter the workplace.

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.790
You know it well, don't you?

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:19.210
I have nothing inferior to you.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.620
Hey. Development Department.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.750
Madam Camula.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.210
Today is Premium Friday.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.500
Return home on time.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.960
Yes, Madam Camula.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:35.580
Pre...premium Friday?

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:40.100
What's wrong with this system?
The name is like ancient magic.

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:45.460
Premium Friday is a campaign
advocated by the government and business sector

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:48.080
to promote consumer spending.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:52.620
It encourages people to enjoy more entertainment
on Fridays at the end of the month.

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:55.110
Employees are allowed
to get off from the work earlier.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:19:00.040
Agastia still practices this
as long as it doesn't affect the work.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:04.080
Even the holidays are arranged
based on everyone's wishes.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.000
How could it be possible?

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.880
Resting is just a waste of time.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:11.000
We should work overtime to show our values.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:15.750
It seems our organisation
is doing a great job on this.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:20.080
We'd be paid according to the time
if we work overtime.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.770
Also, our leave is easily approved.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.000
Ei?

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:29.210
In Black Rock, we can't simply take leave.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:32.420
We must clock out on time if we work overtime.

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:35.620
Besides, we must use a secret passage
and leave secretly

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.920
when we get off from work.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:43.170
That's the responsibility an employee should do.

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:48.080
If so, I heard that the turnover rate
of Black Rock is high.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:51.920
And many people die from overwork.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:55.670
Meaning to say, it's a black company.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:04.120
Not true!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:07.370
Black Rock is an excellent and big organisation.

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:11.000
And I'm sure that I'm the winner in life.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:14.580
As long as I'm loyal to the organisation,

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:17.620
victory always at our side.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.710
Believing in the organisation

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.330
is my power for the future.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:29.210
Excuse me...are you alright?

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.580
Let's go, Elbucky.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:35.460
Premium Friday?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.170
Don't think you've won

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.540
with this little benefit.

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:44.430
A few days later.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:47.460
Kuroitsu.

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.460
I know you were lying the other day.

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.790
My chancellor told me

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.690
that "working is our duty" with a broad smile.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:59.000
I know I'm right.

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:08.330
Fresh graduates who just enter the company
tend to turn a blind eye to the company's vices.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:16.960
Let's go.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.670
Ogre.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.960
Possessing the dragon's power

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.680
and upholding kindness,
I shall eliminate the evil.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:27.970
Here comes Mavel, the God of Souryu.

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:34.000
♫The rain of determination falls
under the scorching sun♫

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:39.320
(Mavel, the God of Souryu)
♫Get rid of the heat♫

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:44.040
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:48.960
♫Always be with you,
I can't see the light. Yeah!♫

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:54.370
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:56.880
(Blade)
♫Always be with you♫

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:04.290
♫Such an ordinary day♫

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:08.970
♫I'm willing to give up everything for you♫

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:14.120
♫Thousands of scars♫

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.070
♫Tears in eyes can no longer flow♫

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:23.750
♫Even the past that I want to erase from memory♫

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:27.960
♫Has become a weapon and let's get♫

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:29.210
♫Ready♫

00:22:29.210 --> 00:22:34.170
♫Ignite my courage with the blade♫

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:39.290
♫Split the path without an answer into two♫

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:42.500
(The Local Heroes in This Episode)
♫And march forward to the future♫

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.540
(Mavel, the God of Souryu)
♫I must be stronger than before♫

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:48.120
(Mavel, the God of Souryu)
♫Let go of the anxiety and run forward♫

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:49.430
(These Heroes Are Not Fictional but Real)
♫Let go of the anxiety and run forward♫

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:54.500
♫Don't stop, carry on.
You can't change my destiny♫

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:05.000
Ogre...

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.420
Ouch.

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:07.830
I got him.

00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:09.200
I don't feel any pain.

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:11.620
- Eat this.
- Ogre...

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:21.580
It's fine. At least I know it.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:25.500
The annihilation of evil is completed.

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:27.500
(A Pure Soul Ravaged by an Invisible Power)
Next episode,

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:30.170
(Bears Fruit Under Extreme Wrath and Impatience)
A pure soul ravaged by an invisible power

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:31.930
(And Show Itself as an Evil Demon)
bears fruit under extreme wrath and impatience...
